Subject: Cantor Self Work Update Broker B1 CDrive Permission Profile Preflight P1 Dual Hemisphere Review

@ [review_uuid] 3109a86d-50c9-4419-8c39-13d589bb068f
@ [source_snapshot_uuid] e8a63d6a-60f1-46c3-add5-73327a0029ae

& [ConstructiveHemisphere]
  + reuse exact B0 SWA-04A and Phase3A forms instead of inventing parallel lineage types
  + extend the independently proved named-profile observation into one complete B1 host preflight with current admission write-prevention process ownership and consequence evidence
  + keep the provider absent because B1 verifies the host boundary before any B2 model work
  + make the next B2 commission causally reachable only through one deterministic independently verified receipt

& [AdversarialHemisphere]
  + a successful allowed read alone does not prove denied reads denied writes current admission stable inventory child quiescence or provider isolation
  + schema wording and profile listing are not enforcement; physical canaries and direct post-state inventory are required
  + an attempted denied write can itself mutate on policy failure so consequence must become may_have_mutated and quarantine without cleanup
  + decoded receipt metadata cannot become a carrier and remote equality cannot substitute for executable replay
  + provider-free means zero model and provider trials rather than synthetic provider success

& [Reconciliation]
  + success requires both prevention evidence and detection evidence after exact child termination
  + the candidate is disposable C-drive scratch and all product principal D-drive evidence and foreign roots remain outside
  + process lifecycle capabilities are granted only to own the preflight App Server child while every mutation publication provider and activation capability remains denied
  + Windows host refusal and WSL storage safety are operational constraints on gates not reasons to weaken semantics

& [Decision]
  + the complete seam is the upstream join plus current revalidation plus allowed read denied read denied write and stable post-state inventory
  + omitting any one of those elements would form a different and insufficient end state
